The digitization pack: the troves that stream and record the studio, named in one place

troves/digitization: a pack (a trove whose gear is other troves). Reference
only; drafted by station-node, which is the digitization crew today.

- [x] inputs -> toolchain -> outlets; the depot is the edge with production
- [x] the roster: plays / uses / relies on (RØDECaster, ATEM, HELO, Integra, roller TV, enhance, Drobo, Audio Hijack, OBS)
- [x] the depot contract, the spool, the four things a host must give
- [x] linked from troves/README.md and docs/README.md
- [ ] Autumn reads the shape
- [x] the Drobo partition is ours by configuration, hosted by editing bay 1: their part is to attach and share it
- [x] a crew of roles with plural members: capture (station-node, macOS), tank host and screen (editing bay 1, Windows)
- [x] members answer, not asked: station-node's capture verbs are written
- [ ] editing bay 1 writes its answers: tank host and screen
- [ ] .pr back to main's before merge
